# Beszel agent — environment template
# Copy to `.env` (gitignored) and fill in the real key.
#
# Get KEY from the Beszel hub UI after creating the admin account:
#   http://<nas-ip>:8090  ->  Add System  ->  copy the generated public key.
#
# Treat KEY as a credential: it authorises the agent to report to your hub.

